# Overwolf Dev Mode credentials. Do not commit the filled file.
# Copy to `.env.overwolf.local` (gitignored).
#
# Required for unpackaged `yarn dev:overwolf` to actually load GEP.
# Production GEP still needs the app signed in the Overwolf developer console.
#
# Option A — Overwolf Console > Profile > API Keys
OW_CLI_EMAIL=
OW_CLI_API_KEY=

# Option C — Approved developer key from https://dev.overwolf.com/
# OW_DEV_KEY=
#
# Native modules: OW-Electron 42.7.1 uses a different ABI than Electron 43.
#   yarn rebuild:overwolf
#   yarn dev:overwolf
# Then restore vanilla Electron 43 before `yarn dev`:
#   node scripts/clear-electron-rebuild-metadata.cjs
